; Language injections for Vuka (.vuka), against tree-sitter-go.
;
; Vuka's embedded languages — Go inside JSX braces, and JSX markup itself — are
; not expressible here, because they are not nodes in the tree-sitter-go
; grammar (a dedicated tree-sitter-vuka grammar would be needed; see README).
; No injections are defined; this file is kept as the documented place to add
; them once such a grammar exists.
